ddress. - the caller must have a balance of at least `amount`."},"transferFrom(address,address,uint256)":{"details":"See {IERC20-transferFrom}.      * Emits an {Approval} event indicating the updated allowance. This is not required by the EIP. See the note at the beginning of {ERC20};      * Requirements: - `sender` and `recipient` cannot be the zero address. - `sender` must have a balance of at least `amount`. - the caller must have allowance for `sender`'s tokens of at least `amount`."}},"title":"MetaToken"},"userdoc":{"methods":{}}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"MetaToken.sol":"MetaToken"},"evmVersion":"istanbul","libraries":{},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":200},"remappings":[]},"sources":{"MetaToken.sol":{"keccak256":"0xd318e24f30581c309a364070a00a5875c6bb303af6d9baf5ad840cb93f7fb620","urls":["bzz-raw://2507591ab204a75e39846e32f5bf23c95ddd79ae01cf3cd15235e13671fdf9d7","dweb:/ipfs/QmWEyqeHm2B3z4pww8DoVAZGTRdi7ZD8GiSpM6Q9BCTTVR"]}},"version":1}